**New**

The literal bucket test (no trailing-week bind + RT bind on `dt`) matches nothing cleanly — the genuinely new names all appeared on the **DA** side. Reporting them as they actually are:

- **`lnsw51-6_me4_rev23`** — first bind ever (record = 08-03 only), day total 1048, lift Z4 load **+19.0**. **Explained**: Mustang–SW 5th 138 kV outage opened 08-03 and runs to 08-27. No seasonal precedent to check because the constraint didn't exist. Carry forward with confidence.
